<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on MIB30 index.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on MIB30 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd has issued a total of five million American-style call and put warrants, in five equal tranches, on the MIB30 index, lead manager and guarantor Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.FEB.97-20.JUL.98   PAYDATE	03.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT    STRIKE   ISSUE	* WARRANT   STRIKE   ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL A     17,000   3,319 ITL  * CALL B    18,500   2,345 ITL</p>
<p> CALL C     20,000   1,596 ITL  *  PUT D    18,000   1,462 ITL</p>
<p>  PUT E     16,500   1,006 ITL  *</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
